  "structuring": {
    "prompt_additions": "Basic unit is ARTICLE not SECTION. Hierarchy: BOOK (codes only) > PART (codes, optional) > TITLE > CHAPTER > SUBDIVISION (Sección, optional) > ARTICLE. Fracciones use Roman numerals (I, II, III) mapped to PARAGRAPH. Incisos use lowercase letters a), b), c) mapped to POINT. Artículos Transitorios appear at end of every instrument — parse as ARTICLE elements; post-processing wraps in hcontainer[transitorios]. Apartados (Apartado A, Apartado B) within articles require post-processing to wrap in hcontainer[apartado]."
  },
